## Campaign lock equality
$ python3 -c import\ json\,sys\;\ a=json.load\(open\(\"/audit-input.json\"\)\)\;\ b=json.load\(open\(\"/audit-campaign-lock.json\"\)\)\;\ print\(\"MATCH\"\ if\ a\[\"audit_campaign\"\]\ ==\ b\ else\ \"MISMATCH\"\)\;\ sys.exit\(0\ if\ a\[\"audit_campaign\"\]\ ==\ b\ else\ 1\)
MATCH
[exit 0]

